        NavigationBar_NavButton__JwONn primary" data-testid="blox-button"><div class="Button_ButtonContent__qPyqO Button_ButtonContent-md__1XTQo"><div class="undefined Button_Text-md__R7FDU Button_BtnText__nrjra  primary " data-testid="text-custom">BOOK PROPERTY</div></div></div></div></div><div class="PropertyDetails_RelativeComponentCtn__xJB6K"><div class="PropertyDetails_BodyWrapper__xzEAL"><div class="PropertyDetails_leftSection__nwaCM"><section id="Overview"><div class="Overview_OverviewMain__jK_BF"><div class="Overview_Overview__Bc1p3 false" data-testid="blox-Overview"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm undefined Overview_HeadingTextOverview__4Xh33"><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Overview</div></h2><div class="Overview_OverviewData__cLXua"><div class="TruncatedText_TruncateText__iKHoI text-12 
            undefined
            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">Samarpan Om Apartment is a premium residential project by Samarpan Homes and Developers, located in the well-connected neighborhood of Borivali East, Mumbai. It offers thoughtfully designed 1, 2, and 4 BHK homes that combine comfort with functionality. The project promises spacious layouts, modern amenities, and high-quality construction. Its strategic location ensures excellent connectivity to schools, hospitals, malls, and public transport. Designed to cater to the needs of modern urban families, Samarpan Om Apartment creates a perfect blend of convenience and lifestyle. It’s an ideal choice for those seeking a well-balanced and future-ready home in Mumbai.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">1 BHK, 2 BHK, 4 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ready to move</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Completed in Jun 2023</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹22,542/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">488 - 1180 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Experience seamless connectivity with the Borivali Railway Station, a vital hub on the Mumbai railway network that serves the local area.</li><li>Benefit from the strategic location with major thoroughfares like SV Road and MG Road connecting you to the surrounding neighborhoods.</li><li>Explore the vibrant nearby areas of Kandivali West, Dahisar East, and Mira Road, each offering unique local attractions and conveniences.</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Enjoy easy access to the Magathane Metro Station on the Dahisar East line, enhancing your commute options.</li><li>Travel effortlessly with the Western Express Highway linking Borivali East to key destinations across Mumbai.</li><li>Reach the Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport in just about 17 kilometers, making air travel a breeze.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="AIReviewSummary"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Container__cdZ_7 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Header__Z33Z1"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleWrapper__VrIqs"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleRow__RxyFc"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_Title__r4_AU"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">Google AI Summary</div></h2><span class="AIReviewSummary_Sparkle__4AIGg">✦</span></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_AiBadge__yHMUt"></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ContentWrapper__H1KTG" style="max-height:380px"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_SummaryText__LoG_f text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Online reviews for Samarpan Om Apartment in Borivali East generally reflect satisfaction with its accessibility and essential living standards, though some residents note limitations in luxury features. Review Summary Resident Satisfaction: Most owners express contentment with the quality of construction and the functional design of the apartments. Connectivity Focus: Reviews frequently highlight the convenience of the location for daily commuting and access to local markets. Management Feedback: The society is generally described as safe and well-maintained by the current residents.</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Grid__9zT79"><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="up-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The good things</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Strategic Connectivity</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project offers easy access to the Western Express Highway and Borivali Railway Station for seamless commuting.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Essential Infrastructure</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Residents benefit from reliable 24/7 water supply and consistent power backup within the premises.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Proximity to Essentials</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The building is located within walking distance of reputable schools, hospitals, and local shopping centers.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Safety Standards</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The society is noted for being a safe environment for families with gated security and CCTV monitoring.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Value for Space</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Apartment layouts are described as well-ventilated with efficient use of carpet area compared to older builds.</div></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="down-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Needs improvement</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Traffic Congestion</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The surrounding roads, particularly during peak hours, are prone to heavy traffic and bottlenecking.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Limited Amenities</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project lacks high-end luxury features such as a swimming pool or a dedicated clubhouse.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Noise Pollution</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Due to its proximity to major roads and the railway line, residents may experience significant ambient noise.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Maintenance Issues</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Some older reviews suggest that long-term building maintenance requires more consistent attention.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Parking Constraints</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Visitor parking is limited, which can be a challenge during social gatherings or events.</div></div></div></div></div><div><hr class="AIReviewSummary_Divider__md7XZ"/><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_VerdictLabel__jEfM0 text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The Verdict</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTags___OivB"><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Great for families</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Excellent for commuters</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Good value for money</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Avoid if seeking luxury amenities</div></span></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_FadeOverlay__CFpBd" style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ToggleContainer__OfGS6 "><button class="AIReviewSummary_ViewMoreBtn__LXBrc"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_BtnText__a2mA5 text_mobile-cta__98PCA" data-testid="text-custom">REVEAL FULL SUMMARY</div><span class="AIReviewSummary_BtnIcon__HS5CT">✦</span><div class="AIReviewSummary_Shimmer__D9tsE"></div></button></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_Amenitie