t="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The status of Samarpan Om Apartment is Ready to move.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Which amenities are provided in Samarpan Om Apartment?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Yoga Area.</div></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordion__RA0cu FAQCard_faqaccordian__mHVRX"><div class="Accordian_accordionTitle__aUov_ FAQCard_title__Dcjuh Accordian_accordionBorderWeb__oM0ZX  FAQCard_closedAcc__v_xws"><div class="Accordian_titleWrapper__y5bxu"><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz"><div class="undefined  text_text-16px__yyDjQ" data-testid="text-custom">Who is the developer of Samarpan Om Apartment?</div></h3></div><div class="Accordian_imageWrapper__BrwaT FAQCard_iconbackground__NBD3A Accordian_LightWrapper__Pja0h "><img alt="arrow-down-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg"/></div></div><div class="Accordian_accordionContent__lzyb_ FAQCard_accordianContent__ZY7na undefined"><div class="FAQCard_FAQTextDesktop__fUtXz">The developer of Samarpan Om Apartment is Samarpan Homes & Developers.</div></div></div></div></section><section id="Developer"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevInfo__z4GBW DeveloperInfo_Darktheme__ON7C5" data-testid="blox-DeveloperInfo"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX squarebx"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">About The Developer</div></h2><div class="GridCont_gridCont__rn4P3  GridCont_row__HRG7b GridCont_center__7YNM7" style="grid-gap:20px;justify-content:flex-start"><div class="DeveloperInfo_DevlogoBox__pRcPe"><img alt="Developer for Samarpan Om Apartment:Samarpan Homes &amp; Developers" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="DeveloperInfo_DevLogo__mXnC6" style="color:transparent" src="https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/210422060040-NewProject(4).png"/></div><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm DeveloperInfo_cardHeading__SkJEX"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-4__YAMBJ" data-testid="text-custom">Samarpan Homes &amp; Developers</div></h2></div><div class="undefined DeveloperInfo_DevText__0bBIr text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Samarpan Homes and Developers, an ascending force in Mumbai&#x27;s real estate arena, upholds exacting standards and envisions a prominent presence in the industry. Fueled by a commitment to absolute customer satisfaction, the company endeavors to establish new benchmarks through its awe-inspiring projects. Operating with unwavering transparency, it seeks to not only meet but surpass customer expectations. The company diligently ensures that its projects boast superior amenities, delivering unparalleled value for money and a profound sense of satisfaction to its discerning clientele. In the dynamic landscape of real estate, Samarpan Homes and Developers aspires to redefine excellence.</div></div></section><div data-testid="same-area-prop-ctn"><div class="SameAreaProperties_SameAreaPropertiesCtn__qfNU_ Card_primary__IiLET Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderCtn__mGuOf CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 SameAreaProperties_CardHeader__EDw78" data-testid="card-header"><div class="CardHeader_CardHeaderTitle__GzXgr CardHeader_CardHeaderTitleSecondary__w6GWM gheader"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm CardHeader_Card-Text-20__QQqX5 "><div class="undefined  " data-testid="text-custom">Properties In The Same Area</div></h2></div><div class="CardHeader_CardIconCtn__IwxSE "><img alt="bloxsquare" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg"/></div></div><div><div class="swiper Swiper_SwiperCtn__bi0fK SameAreaProperties_SwiperClass__tmPO8"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide Swiper_SwiperSlide__BWsJ2 SameAreaProperties_SwiperSliderClassName__IpLlP"><div class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardCtn__yVyLN " data-testid="propertycard-ctn" style="width:296px;height:480px"><a class="HiddenLinksSEO" href="/projects/ava-maple"></a><img alt="Property-Image" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" data-nimg="fill" class=" PropertyCard_PropertyCardImage__9Zvsn" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/ava-lifespaces-ava-maple-1754033035.jpg"/><div class="PropertyCard_PropertyDataCtn__eihK5 PropertyCard_PropertyDataCtnLg__4_AmE  " style="width:296px;height:480px"><div class="PropertyCard_PropertyImageCtn_